{"seq":41,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a2523"},"reason":"The body said Pisa is 'usually named as the oldest' without qualification; the museum's own region (Visit Tuscany) and Italian sources describe it as 'one of the oldest in the world'. The sentence and notes now say so, keeping Pisa as the card's answer.","by":"provenance-research","sources":[{"url":"https://www.visittuscany.com/en/attractions/natural-history-museum-of-pisa"},{"url":"https://it.wikipedia.org/wiki/Museo_di_storia_naturale_dell%27Universit%C3%A0_di_Pisa"}],"changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",358],["+","– officially described as \"one of the oldest in the world\" – "],["=",515]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",294],["+","– offiziell „eines der ältesten der Welt“ – "],["=",501]]},{"field":"bodyRu","diff":[["=",294],["-","музей."],["+","музей — официально «один из старейших в мире»."],["=",446]]},{"field":"notesEn","diff":[["=",57],["+"," The museum itself and the Tuscan tourism board call it \"one of the oldest in the world\"; \"Pisa\" is the usual answer for the oldest."]]},{"field":"notesDe","diff":[["=",51],["+"," Das Museum selbst und die toskanische Tourismusbehörde nennen es „eines der ältesten der Welt“; „Pisa“ ist die übliche Antwort auf die Frage nach dem ältesten."]]},{"field":"notesRu","diff":[["=",47],["+"," Сам музей и туристическое ведомство Тосканы называют его «одним из старейших в мире»; «Пиза» — обычный ответ на вопрос о старейшем."]]}],"hash":"192f29a32bdc","actor":{"kind":"agent","name":"provenance-research"},"run":"provenance-research-2026-10-23","chain":"2635cb7a585166810d456b997d902a208f94432966252a32e0cfbfbdd052f6b1"},
